WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Before and after: better agentic linting in Agent Canvas.

00:04.000 --> 00:14.000
Readable errors: MCP validation text uses a theme-aware error token.

00:14.000 --> 00:24.000
Readable success: successful MCP connections use a theme-aware success token.

00:24.000 --> 00:34.000
Calmer switch: “Also save as secret” uses the shared toggle and readable theme colors.

00:34.000 --> 00:46.000
Phone fit: the secret name and help control wrap together; keyboard focus remains visible.

00:46.000 --> 00:56.000
Caret guard: overriding a stateful caret's rotation now triggers a lint error. Use isOpen.

00:56.000 --> 01:08.000
Inline warnings: direct width styles now warn. Dynamic CSS variables and public host styles are preserved.

01:08.000 --> 01:20.000
After: the shared secret-selection switch in all five supported themes.

01:20.000 --> 01:24.000
Two visual proposals remove fifteen raw-color findings. The rule changes are staged separately.
